<section vertical-align="center" id="bbs023" image-layout="blank"><card-template-instructions>Two columns under a working title: what is done as a plain list on the left, what is open as checklist rows on the right, each column with a subtitle and a list of matched length.</card-template-instructions><grid spacing="none"><grid-item id="_WtylKCHcA"><h2>Where the relaunch stands</h2><grid spacing="medium"><grid-item colspan="30" id="eSfmqb1vu5"><h3>Done</h3><ul><li>Pricing approved for both new lines</li><li>Packaging revised and in stock</li><li>Top twenty accounts briefed by phone</li></ul></grid-item><grid-item colspan="30" id="tRjPpCRVpP"><h3>Open before September</h3><todo>Training material for the sales team</todo><todo>Product pages updated with the new pricing</todo><todo>Launch stock reserved at the regional depot</todo><todo>First-order incentive agreed with finance</todo></grid-item></grid></grid-item></grid></section>